WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.350
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to do&nbsp;
at the Foundation: Stop messing with Star Wars!

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.510
We get it, you love movies. And the Star&nbsp;
Wars films are classics! Even if some of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:15.250
old special effects don't age perfectly.&nbsp;
But no matter how big of a fan you are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.450
that doesn't give you the right to&nbsp;
make any edits to the original films,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.590
anomalous or otherwise, in an&nbsp;
attempt to digitally enhance them.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.590
And definitely don't upload The&nbsp;
Bright Cut of those films to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.770
the internet. You're just asking&nbsp;
for a lawsuit from George Lucas!

